<title>CHINA: China posts January soy product imports, exports.</title>
<headline>China posts January soy product imports, exports.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of soybean, soymill and soyoil as reported in official customs figures (percentage change is for January 1997 compared with same period of last year):</p>
<p>		 JANUARY IMPORTS	   VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	  400,791			Not available (NA)</p>
<p> Soymeal	  369,424			NA</p>
<p> Soyoil	   168,195			+ 13 percent</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		  JANUARY EXPORTS	  VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	    5,308			NA</p>
<p> Soymeal	    1,300			NA</p>
<p> Soyoil		 152			+ 84 percent</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
